{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_155_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_155","textTraditional":"一、五年。春，公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_155_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_155","textTraditional":"二、夏，鄭伯使公子發來聘。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_155_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_155","textTraditional":"三、叔孫豹、鄫世子巫如晉。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_155_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_155","textTraditional":"外相如不書，此何以書？為叔孫豹率而與之俱也。叔孫豹則曷為率而與之俱？蓋舅出也。莒將滅之，故相與往殆乎晉也。莒將滅之，則曷為相與往殆乎晉？取後乎莒也。其取後乎莒奈何？莒女有為鄫夫人者，蓋欲立其出也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_155_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_155","textTraditional":"四、仲孫蔑、衞孫林父會吳于善稻。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_155_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_155","textTraditional":"五、秋，大雩。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_155_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_155","textTraditional":"六、楚殺其大夫公子壬夫。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_155_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_155","textTraditional":"七、公會晉侯、宋公、陳侯、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、邾婁子、滕子、薛伯、齊世子光、吳人、鄫人于戚。公至自會。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_155_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_155","textTraditional":"吳何以稱人？吳、鄫人云則不辭。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_155_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_155","textTraditional":"八、冬，戍陳。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_155_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_155","textTraditional":"孰戍之？諸侯戍之。曷為不言諸侯戍之？離至不可得而序，故言我也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_155_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_155","textTraditional":"九、楚公子貞帥師伐陳。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_155_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_155","textTraditional":"十、公會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、邾婁子、滕子、薛伯、齊世子光救陳。十有二月，公至自救陳。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_155_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_155","textTraditional":"十一、辛未，季孫行父卒。","sentenceOrder":14}],"overrides":{}}